WEBVTT

00:06.208 --> 00:07.458
[wind howling]

00:07.541 --> 00:10.583
-[brooding music playing]
-[Saga breathing shakily]

00:10.666 --> 00:12.166
[men whimpering]

00:20.250 --> 00:21.375
[groans]

00:29.291 --> 00:30.958
[Kanjiya] It's not enough.

00:35.125 --> 00:36.666
-It's not enough!
-[man yelps]

00:37.916 --> 00:38.916
[groans]

00:43.125 --> 00:45.208
Kokushu the Manslayer.

00:46.000 --> 00:47.958
I haven't had enough fun yet.

00:48.875 --> 00:50.916
Let's fight to the death.

00:53.208 --> 00:54.916
The war is already over.

00:56.625 --> 00:58.125
[Kanjiya laughs]

00:58.208 --> 01:00.083
But we're samurai, aren't we?

01:00.875 --> 01:02.208
So we fight.

01:03.500 --> 01:06.666
[laughs] It went by so fast.

01:07.375 --> 01:10.708
Those bastards
with their rifles and their cannons.

01:10.791 --> 01:11.625
[groans]

01:14.625 --> 01:15.625
See?

01:16.625 --> 01:18.875
That is all it takes.

01:18.958 --> 01:21.500
[scoffs]
It doesn't even feel like killing.

01:21.583 --> 01:23.750
A neat and clean little weapon.

01:24.458 --> 01:25.791
[sword tearing flesh]

01:27.125 --> 01:29.500
The days of the sword
are coming to an end.

01:32.625 --> 01:35.041
The world doesn't need swordsmen like us.

01:35.541 --> 01:38.458
But that won't change who we truly are.

01:38.541 --> 01:41.166
You and I will always be manslayers,
no matter what.

01:43.750 --> 01:45.083
You killed this one, didn't you?

01:46.125 --> 01:47.375
Not bad at all.

01:48.958 --> 01:51.000
Why don't you show me how you do it?

01:54.708 --> 01:56.625
[grunts, panting]

02:04.750 --> 02:05.750
[grunts]

02:08.500 --> 02:09.333
[grunting]

02:09.416 --> 02:11.083
[dramatic music playing]

02:12.500 --> 02:13.375
[yells]

02:16.500 --> 02:18.291
[breathing heavily]

02:24.666 --> 02:28.250
[chuckles]
Is that enough to get you to fight?

02:33.208 --> 02:34.875
[grunting]

02:34.958 --> 02:37.291
[dramatic music intensifies]

02:41.000 --> 02:42.333
[Kanjiya screams]

02:42.416 --> 02:44.375
[Kanjiya groaning, panting]

02:52.875 --> 02:54.375
[dramatic music fades]

02:54.458 --> 02:56.000
Go on, do it.

02:56.083 --> 02:57.416
Kill me.

03:02.791 --> 03:04.958
If you leave me here alive,

03:05.041 --> 03:07.958
I'll keep following you
to the ends of the earth.

03:12.041 --> 03:13.750
No. It's over.

03:13.833 --> 03:15.583
[brooding music playing]

03:24.625 --> 03:27.000
[shouting] I will see you again!

03:28.291 --> 03:30.750
Saga Kokushu!

03:31.750 --> 03:33.208
[laughing]

03:40.125 --> 03:41.916
[continues laughing]

03:43.291 --> 03:44.750
[doors slam heavily]

03:52.083 --> 03:54.041
[guard] The age of the samurai is over.

03:54.125 --> 03:56.125
You'll be locked in here until you die.

03:58.625 --> 04:00.750
-[door closes]
-[footsteps receding]

04:04.750 --> 04:06.541
[somber music playing]

04:06.625 --> 04:08.750
[prisoners groaning softly]

04:11.916 --> 04:13.208
[Kanjiya groans]

04:23.166 --> 04:25.916
[whispers] I want to fight.

04:27.416 --> 04:29.416
[footsteps approaching]

04:38.125 --> 04:39.625
Look how miserable you are,

04:40.458 --> 04:42.000
Kanjiya Bukotsu.

04:42.083 --> 04:43.458
[somber music fades]

04:43.541 --> 04:45.916
You were gone for ten years,

04:46.000 --> 04:49.416
and then you decided to return
for the Satsuma Rebellion.

04:49.500 --> 04:51.750
You even killed your own allies.

04:55.000 --> 04:57.375
What has your life been like since then?

05:01.625 --> 05:05.041
You're asking me
what my life has been like?

05:05.125 --> 05:06.625
[somber music resumes]

05:07.541 --> 05:09.333
I've been dead

05:10.791 --> 05:12.708
for a while now.

05:15.583 --> 05:17.500
I bear good news.

05:17.583 --> 05:20.500
You'll have one more chance
to walk the path of the samurai.

05:23.166 --> 05:24.000
Huh?

05:32.625 --> 05:34.166
[keys jingling, turning]

05:34.708 --> 05:36.333
HOKOKU NEWSPAPER
PARTICIPANTS WANTED

05:43.416 --> 05:45.250
[footsteps receding]

05:46.208 --> 05:48.208
-[door opens]
-[laughing]

05:49.875 --> 05:51.458
[door closes heavily]

05:59.916 --> 06:01.291
-[squelching]
-[man screams]

06:01.375 --> 06:02.958
[guard 1] Hey! What's going on in here?

06:03.041 --> 06:04.250
[guard 2 groans]

06:04.333 --> 06:06.541
-[dramatic music playing]
-[guard 1 gasping]

06:19.250 --> 06:21.000
-[yelling]
-[screaming]

06:22.083 --> 06:23.416
[dramatic music continues]

06:53.083 --> 06:54.250
[music fades]

06:54.333 --> 06:55.583
[clock ticking]

06:57.583 --> 06:58.750
TO TOSHIYOSHI KAWAJI

06:58.833 --> 07:02.375
WE MUST DISCUSS THE FUTURE OF THE POLICE.
I AWAIT YOU IN TOKYO.

07:02.458 --> 07:04.458
[brooding music playing]

07:05.958 --> 07:07.416
[Kawaji] Lord Okubo!

07:08.750 --> 07:09.875
[door opens]

07:12.333 --> 07:15.125
Lord Okubo, please listen to me.

07:15.208 --> 07:18.041
This rebellion is our chance
to finally destroy the samurai.

07:18.125 --> 07:21.250
We must exterminate them,
or else they will rebel once again.

07:21.333 --> 07:24.958
All I'm asking is for you
to grant us the right to carry guns.

07:26.416 --> 07:28.458
-I won't.
-Why not, sir?

07:29.000 --> 07:31.750
What will you do if one of them tries
to sneak in and assassinate you?

07:31.833 --> 07:33.125
How will we protect you?

07:33.208 --> 07:35.041
Have them forfeit their swords.

07:36.333 --> 07:38.541
-That is all I can allow.
-[Kawaji] Okubo!

07:39.166 --> 07:42.375
[sighs] We shouldn't use too heavy a hand.

07:42.458 --> 07:44.625
It will only lead to new uprisings.

07:44.708 --> 07:47.625
Remember Kyoto
during the shogunate's final days?

07:47.708 --> 07:50.416
Think of how many
of our comrades had fallen back then,

07:50.500 --> 07:53.000
killed by the swords of samurai assassins.

07:53.875 --> 07:55.250
Should they plot to kill us,

07:55.333 --> 07:57.291
we have no way
of defending ourselves against them.

07:57.375 --> 07:59.375
Their speed and power are unstoppable!

07:59.458 --> 08:03.666
We need to be able to bear firearms
for the sake of the future of Japan.

08:04.291 --> 08:07.458
There is no point
in fighting brute force with brute force!

08:08.333 --> 08:10.333
The future of Japan, you say.

08:10.416 --> 08:13.875
Do you know what Japan must have
in order to grow stronger as a nation?

08:13.958 --> 08:17.041
-The people, Kawaji!
-And the people need to be protected!

08:17.125 --> 08:19.333
You'll never win the people with violence!

08:19.416 --> 08:21.416
How can you not understand?

08:25.666 --> 08:26.666
Kawaji.

08:28.416 --> 08:30.541
The days of the samurai are done.

08:31.208 --> 08:32.291
However,

08:33.250 --> 08:36.833
if we cannot be united and live in peace,

08:40.083 --> 08:42.250
our nation will be destroyed.

08:48.375 --> 08:49.750
[inhales sharply]

09:05.083 --> 09:06.333
I will not give in.

09:07.291 --> 09:08.833
As long as I'm breathing.

09:18.208 --> 09:19.208
[door opens]

09:20.750 --> 09:21.750
[door slams]

09:30.208 --> 09:31.750
[brooding music fades]

09:31.833 --> 09:32.833
[exhales]

09:45.791 --> 09:47.041
[wind howling]

09:58.791 --> 10:00.791
THE KODOKU PROJECT

10:08.666 --> 10:10.458
[footsteps approaching]

10:10.541 --> 10:11.916
[man] Lord Kawaji.

10:15.250 --> 10:16.250
Come in.

10:19.375 --> 10:20.958
Sorry to interrupt.

10:23.625 --> 10:26.208
Lord Okubo has sent you a telegram.

10:29.000 --> 10:31.166
[Okubo] To Kawaji Toshiyoshi.

10:31.250 --> 10:33.666
Need to discuss future of police.

10:33.750 --> 10:35.583
Awaiting you in Tokyo.

10:36.208 --> 10:37.750
Come promptly.

10:41.583 --> 10:42.750
[drum beating]

10:42.833 --> 10:45.333
[people laughing, speaking indistinctly]

10:55.458 --> 10:57.958
[vendor] There's something for everyone!
Miss, right this way!

10:59.875 --> 11:01.708
[folk music playing]

11:01.791 --> 11:02.708
[laughs]

11:04.333 --> 11:06.125
[chanting]

11:24.625 --> 11:25.541
Futaba.

11:26.041 --> 11:26.958
Yes?

11:27.458 --> 11:28.458
You can go.

11:30.416 --> 11:31.416
Is that all right?

11:31.958 --> 11:32.958
Sure.

11:36.291 --> 11:37.750
Thank you so much.

11:41.916 --> 11:42.958
Are you sure?

11:44.000 --> 11:47.208
We have two days
before the appointment, and…

11:48.125 --> 11:50.250
these could be our last days together.

12:10.041 --> 12:12.666
Strange to see you
with that look on your face.

12:14.125 --> 12:15.333
What do you mean?

12:18.333 --> 12:21.583
You look like a father
who's worried about his child.

12:30.541 --> 12:33.166
Did having a family make you happy?

12:37.208 --> 12:38.208
Yes.

12:45.708 --> 12:48.000
What's it like having a real family?

12:50.125 --> 12:52.000
[somber music playing]

13:20.000 --> 13:23.166
I was able to live life peacefully,
without killing anybody.

13:25.333 --> 13:28.500
So I would do
whatever it takes to save them.

13:38.333 --> 13:39.583
[Iroha] As for me…

13:42.583 --> 13:44.708
I've only been thinking of one thing.

13:47.166 --> 13:49.750
I should've just died
in the battle for succession.

13:50.250 --> 13:51.708
It'd be better than this life.

13:53.125 --> 13:54.166
Iroha.

13:54.791 --> 13:56.250
Don't say that. I didn't--

13:56.333 --> 13:57.416
Yes, I know.

14:01.208 --> 14:02.375
I know that.

14:05.125 --> 14:06.041
[inhales]

14:07.458 --> 14:08.875
I'm going for a walk.

14:09.375 --> 14:10.791
[somber music fades]

14:10.875 --> 14:13.375
[folk music, chanting continue]

14:19.916 --> 14:21.791
[Sansuke] What do you mean?
What kind of trouble?

14:22.916 --> 14:24.416
Keep talking.

14:24.500 --> 14:26.541
Saga Shujiro and Kinugasa Iroha

14:27.125 --> 14:29.625
are going to die
unless you go and help them out.

14:31.750 --> 14:33.083
Wait, it's not…

14:33.708 --> 14:34.750
Gentosai, is it?

14:34.833 --> 14:37.625
Oh! Well done. That's the right answer.

14:37.708 --> 14:40.583
They're holding a festival
at the shrine just ahead.

14:40.666 --> 14:42.958
-That's where the two of them are.
-[breathing shakily]

14:43.041 --> 14:45.000
-Gentosai as well.
-[tense music playing]

14:45.833 --> 14:46.916
Who are you?

14:47.791 --> 14:48.708
What do you want?

14:49.291 --> 14:50.541
[Kyojin] Hmm…

14:51.333 --> 14:54.541
I'm not even sure anymore, honestly.

14:56.333 --> 14:57.708
You should hurry.

15:05.958 --> 15:07.083
[Shinnosuke] Kyojin.

15:07.166 --> 15:10.208
[panting] Who are they?
What was all that? And who's Gentosai?

15:10.291 --> 15:11.166
Shinnosuke.

15:12.000 --> 15:15.333
In this world, some things are better
left kept in the dark, okay?

15:15.416 --> 15:16.291
But--

15:17.458 --> 15:18.625
[ominous music playing]

15:18.708 --> 15:21.000
Might as well just have some fun, right?

15:21.916 --> 15:24.083
After all, we're stuck in this Kodoku.

15:28.583 --> 15:30.625
[folk music playing]

15:30.708 --> 15:32.291
[chanting]

15:44.666 --> 15:46.333
[man breathing heavily]

15:49.375 --> 15:51.791
[people speaking indistinctly, laughing]

15:56.041 --> 15:57.250
[bell tinkling]

16:02.041 --> 16:04.208
[background noise softens]

16:04.791 --> 16:06.291
[bell continues tinkling]

16:10.875 --> 16:11.708
[exhales]

16:12.750 --> 16:16.875
The eighth successor of the Kyohachi-ryu,

16:16.958 --> 16:19.291
Kinugasa Iroha.

16:20.375 --> 16:22.000
I finally found you.

16:22.083 --> 16:23.208
[dramatic music playing]

16:23.291 --> 16:24.625
[breathing shakily]

16:25.333 --> 16:26.708
Why is he here?

16:43.583 --> 16:45.125
[dramatic music fades]

16:45.208 --> 16:46.708
[indistinct chatter]

16:48.750 --> 16:50.708
All right, let's get started.

16:50.791 --> 16:52.000
Yes, sir!

16:53.000 --> 16:54.000
Here we go!

16:57.791 --> 17:00.083
[crowd gasping, murmuring]

17:02.083 --> 17:03.041
[man whoops]

17:07.875 --> 17:09.041
[woman screams]

17:09.125 --> 17:10.041
[crowd quietens]

17:13.333 --> 17:15.333
[dramatic sting]

17:15.416 --> 17:16.750
[crowd murmuring]

17:17.333 --> 17:18.875
-[ominous music playing]
-[gasps]

17:20.750 --> 17:22.125
[breath trembling]

17:23.916 --> 17:25.875
-[panting]
-[bell tinkling]

17:27.583 --> 17:28.583
[groans]

17:31.166 --> 17:33.375
[Gentosai breathing heavily]

17:50.750 --> 17:52.833
We meet again at last.

17:55.833 --> 17:56.916
Kokushu!

17:57.000 --> 17:59.708
-[dramatic music playing]
-[crowd screaming]

18:02.708 --> 18:03.625
[grunting]

18:03.708 --> 18:06.458
[Kanjiya] It's time
we settled this once and for all!

18:10.458 --> 18:13.125
-[firework bursts]
-Get back! Get back! Get back!

18:16.500 --> 18:17.458
[groans]

18:17.541 --> 18:18.791
[tense music playing]

18:18.875 --> 18:19.875
[panting]

18:25.875 --> 18:27.333
Oh man.

18:28.208 --> 18:30.958
There's no thrill like trying
to kill each other, huh?

18:31.708 --> 18:33.916
You must be a beast
to find pleasure in murder.

18:34.000 --> 18:35.875
Yeah, but you're no different.

18:37.041 --> 18:39.250
And none of it matters.

18:39.333 --> 18:41.375
-What's the point of anything anymore?
-[screaming]

18:41.458 --> 18:42.375
[gasping]

18:44.041 --> 18:47.250
I'll smash every bit
of this meaningless world!

18:47.333 --> 18:49.541
-[Futaba] Stop this!
-[crowd quietens]

18:50.208 --> 18:51.291
[gasps]

18:53.166 --> 18:54.666
[breathing shakily]

18:55.250 --> 18:57.125
What was that, darling?

18:58.458 --> 19:01.125
Why shed the blood
of those who have done nothing?

19:02.208 --> 19:03.458
That's not the samurai way!

19:03.541 --> 19:04.916
Futaba! Stand down!

19:06.916 --> 19:08.625
Then what is the samurai way?

19:14.125 --> 19:15.291
Come on, sweetheart.

19:15.375 --> 19:17.166
-[crowd exclaiming]
-Tell me, what is it?

19:18.750 --> 19:20.916
Don't do it, Bukotsu. Let go of her.

19:22.541 --> 19:24.208
What if I killed her?

19:26.000 --> 19:27.833
I think that you'd fight me then, right?

19:27.916 --> 19:30.000
Don't. Stop this.

19:30.083 --> 19:31.541
Don't do it!

19:31.625 --> 19:32.666
[laughing]

19:32.750 --> 19:34.333
[breathing shakily]

19:43.958 --> 19:45.541
[bell tinkling]

19:45.625 --> 19:47.333
[floorboards creaking]

20:14.208 --> 20:16.250
-[fireworks bursting]
-[gasping]

20:16.333 --> 20:18.333
[suspenseful music playing]

20:21.750 --> 20:23.041
[breathing heavily]

20:32.500 --> 20:33.750
[bell tinkles]

20:35.791 --> 20:37.791
[suspenseful music intensifies]

20:43.125 --> 20:44.291
Oh.

20:44.875 --> 20:46.625
-[squelching]
-[whimpers]

20:46.708 --> 20:48.375
[dramatic music playing]

20:49.250 --> 20:50.250
[groaning]

20:53.166 --> 20:54.791
[bell tinkling]

20:54.875 --> 20:56.375
[breathing heavily]

20:58.500 --> 20:59.333
[screaming]

20:59.416 --> 21:02.458
-[crowd clamoring]
-[fireworks bursting]

21:03.583 --> 21:04.583
[Kanjiya yells]

21:05.958 --> 21:06.958
[grunts]

21:08.791 --> 21:09.958
[laughing]

21:16.583 --> 21:18.333
Out of the way! Move!

21:20.541 --> 21:21.458
[whimpering]

21:22.333 --> 21:23.416
[grunting]

21:27.166 --> 21:28.291
[groans, panting]

21:28.375 --> 21:29.500
[dramatic music fades]

21:35.541 --> 21:37.250
[Saga] You can't win
with your arm like that.

21:37.333 --> 21:38.833
Just give up.

21:40.875 --> 21:42.916
You're telling me to give up now?

21:44.708 --> 21:47.333
We ended up like this
all because we gave up, didn't we?

21:49.375 --> 21:51.916
How did you feel
when they took your sword away?

21:54.208 --> 21:56.333
Have you been happy with your life?

22:00.208 --> 22:02.833
-Yes, I truly have.
-[Kanjiya] Then why are you here?

22:02.916 --> 22:03.916
[brooding music playing]

22:04.666 --> 22:06.250
I'll tell you why.

22:06.750 --> 22:07.708
Because in the end,

22:07.791 --> 22:09.791
you're only worth something
if you can kill.

22:10.666 --> 22:11.750
[Kanjiya chuckles]

22:12.333 --> 22:15.125
You can't even save a single person
without killing.

22:21.208 --> 22:23.541
The age of the samurai is over?

22:24.416 --> 22:26.291
I say to hell with that.

22:26.791 --> 22:28.000
And even if it is,

22:29.291 --> 22:31.583
we will just rebuild it once again!

22:31.666 --> 22:32.666
[grunting]

22:32.750 --> 22:34.166
[crowd exclaiming]

22:38.083 --> 22:39.125
[yells]

22:39.208 --> 22:40.958
-[dramatic music playing]
-[crowd screaming]

22:41.041 --> 22:42.000
[Kanjiya grunts]

22:42.083 --> 22:43.083
[panting]

22:46.708 --> 22:48.083
[dramatic music fades]

22:48.166 --> 22:49.500
[bell tinkling]

22:58.541 --> 23:00.458
[Gentosai breathing heavily]

23:03.833 --> 23:04.958
[tinkling stops]

23:08.416 --> 23:09.833
[breathing shakily]

23:15.916 --> 23:17.458
[eerie music playing]

23:17.541 --> 23:18.541
Hmm.

23:26.291 --> 23:27.666
[eerie music ends abruptly]

23:30.875 --> 23:31.833
[grunting]

23:31.916 --> 23:33.666
[tense music playing]

23:40.458 --> 23:42.458
[Gentosai breathing heavily]

23:47.458 --> 23:49.333
[Gentosai] I found you.

23:51.458 --> 23:52.625
[Iroha grunts]

24:03.416 --> 24:04.791
[tense music fades]

24:04.875 --> 24:06.541
[indistinct chatter]

24:07.166 --> 24:08.583
[people screaming]

24:10.041 --> 24:12.500
-[dramatic music playing]
-[grunting]

24:12.583 --> 24:13.583
[groaning]

24:20.875 --> 24:22.333
[Kanjiya] Out of the way!

24:23.708 --> 24:24.791
[woman screaming]

24:28.541 --> 24:29.708
[Saga] Run!

24:29.791 --> 24:30.791
[grunting]

24:33.041 --> 24:34.041
[yelling]

24:37.875 --> 24:39.583
[dramatic music fades]

24:46.250 --> 24:48.250
[Gentosai breathing heavily]

24:49.291 --> 24:50.500
[grunting]

24:50.583 --> 24:52.708
[dramatic music resumes]

25:04.500 --> 25:06.416
[dramatic music fades]

25:06.500 --> 25:07.375
[panting]

25:10.250 --> 25:11.291
[groans]

25:12.958 --> 25:14.791
[tense music playing]

25:14.875 --> 25:16.708
That was an impressive strike.

25:18.333 --> 25:19.625
[Gentosai grunts]

25:19.708 --> 25:21.875
But this is the end for you.

25:22.375 --> 25:24.500
Do you have any last words?

25:25.041 --> 25:26.708
[breathing heavily]

25:27.291 --> 25:29.041
If that was your best,

25:31.125 --> 25:34.291
you'll never stand a chance
against my brothers.

25:35.458 --> 25:37.000
Oh really?

25:37.958 --> 25:41.500
Don't worry. Your siblings will be next.

25:44.000 --> 25:45.166
[music intensifies]

25:47.125 --> 25:48.375
[Shikura grunting]

25:50.291 --> 25:51.958
[dramatic music playing]

25:56.291 --> 25:57.625
[growls]

26:03.708 --> 26:05.916
[Gentosai breathing heavily]

26:11.250 --> 26:15.208
The fourth successor of the Kyohachi-ryu,

26:16.041 --> 26:18.125
Adashino Shikura.

26:19.916 --> 26:20.916
[exhales]

26:22.083 --> 26:23.250
[grunting]

26:25.875 --> 26:27.000
[Gentosai gasps]

26:31.041 --> 26:32.125
[grunts]

26:35.125 --> 26:36.125
[groans]

26:36.875 --> 26:39.625
[panting] I can't believe he dodged that.

26:39.708 --> 26:41.208
[breathing shakily]

26:41.291 --> 26:43.541
The third successor,

26:45.500 --> 26:48.000
Gion Sansuke.

26:50.833 --> 26:51.833
[grunting]

27:06.208 --> 27:07.083
[grunting]

27:09.958 --> 27:11.125
[Sansuke panting]

27:13.791 --> 27:15.833
-[Shikura yells]
-[grunting]

27:20.208 --> 27:21.958
[yells, groans]

27:24.666 --> 27:26.708
-Wretched monster!
-[breathing heavily]

27:26.791 --> 27:28.291
[grunting]

27:42.333 --> 27:43.375
Sansuke.

27:44.833 --> 27:45.875
Move as one.

27:45.958 --> 27:47.000
[Sansuke] Right.

27:48.875 --> 27:49.750
[grunting]

27:57.250 --> 27:58.458
[groans]

28:00.041 --> 28:01.583
[Shikura] He's too strong.

28:02.083 --> 28:03.916
[breathing heavily]

28:04.000 --> 28:05.083
You run!

28:05.166 --> 28:07.708
-[suspenseful music playing]
-[breathing shakily]

28:13.083 --> 28:15.208
[Sansuke] Iroha! Let's move!

28:17.541 --> 28:18.541
[panting]

28:23.541 --> 28:24.583
[grunting]

28:26.916 --> 28:27.791
[Shikura groans]

28:32.250 --> 28:33.083
[grunting]

28:37.916 --> 28:39.083
[Gentosai groans]

28:41.166 --> 28:43.000
[suspenseful music fades]

28:43.083 --> 28:44.250
[inhales sharply]

28:45.166 --> 28:46.166
[growls]

28:47.916 --> 28:50.375
-[breathing heavily]
-[ominous music playing]

29:03.000 --> 29:04.208
[screaming]

29:05.041 --> 29:06.500
[shouting] Move!

29:06.583 --> 29:07.791
[dramatic music playing]

29:07.875 --> 29:09.041
[grunting]

29:10.416 --> 29:11.416
[yells]

29:11.500 --> 29:12.500
[groaning]

29:13.500 --> 29:14.833
[crowd clamoring]

29:14.916 --> 29:16.666
-[panting]
-[dramatic music fades]

29:19.541 --> 29:21.125
[tense music playing]

29:29.250 --> 29:30.583
[yelling]

29:30.666 --> 29:31.833
[yelling]

29:33.916 --> 29:35.000
[grunting]

29:35.083 --> 29:36.500
[dramatic music playing]

29:45.000 --> 29:45.958
[yells]

29:47.958 --> 29:49.833
-[sword tearing flesh]
-[grunting]

29:57.208 --> 29:58.250
[panting]

30:09.958 --> 30:11.958
[yelling]

30:12.541 --> 30:13.916
[grunting]

30:19.750 --> 30:21.000
[yelling]

30:32.416 --> 30:34.083
[panting]

30:39.875 --> 30:41.666
-[speaking indistinctly]
-[gasping]

31:00.791 --> 31:02.500
-[yelling]
-[grunting]

31:30.500 --> 31:31.458
[yelling]

31:38.958 --> 31:40.458
-[dramatic music ends]
-[crowd gasping]

31:40.541 --> 31:41.666
[man] Move! Get back!

31:41.750 --> 31:43.833
-[breathing shakily]
-[man] Get back! Move!

31:43.916 --> 31:45.666
Get away! Come on!

31:49.250 --> 31:51.875
-[crowd screaming, clamoring]
-[woman] Move! It's not safe!

32:04.958 --> 32:05.833
[gasps]

32:05.916 --> 32:07.416
[tense music playing]

32:25.541 --> 32:27.000
[groaning]

32:27.083 --> 32:28.083
[panting]

32:28.166 --> 32:29.833
[tense music fades]

33:08.500 --> 33:10.500
-[grunts]
-[metallic ringing]

33:23.208 --> 33:24.625
[groaning]

33:32.583 --> 33:34.000
[water splashes]

33:45.291 --> 33:48.250
Kokushu the Manslayer… [breathing shakily]

33:56.000 --> 33:57.500
At long last…

34:00.416 --> 34:03.000
I finally found happiness.

34:06.291 --> 34:07.916
[Kanjiya wheezing]

34:16.500 --> 34:17.875
[breathing heavily]

34:24.000 --> 34:25.958
[panting] Shujiro!

34:26.041 --> 34:26.875
[Saga coughs]

34:26.958 --> 34:29.708
Shujiro! Shujiro!

34:30.416 --> 34:32.125
[somber music playing]

34:59.500 --> 35:00.916
[Saga coughs]

35:11.416 --> 35:13.166
[somber music fades]

35:14.500 --> 35:16.083
[birds chirping]

35:18.375 --> 35:20.083
[mechanical clicking]

35:22.666 --> 35:24.916
The first participant to reach Chiryu was…

35:27.458 --> 35:30.083
227, Kamuykocha.

35:30.166 --> 35:31.750
[groaning]

35:31.833 --> 35:34.250
Good! Yes, yes, very good!

35:34.333 --> 35:36.750
He didn't come all the way
from Ezo for nothing.

35:37.333 --> 35:40.916
We've received another report
that Kanjiya Bukotsu was just killed.

35:41.000 --> 35:43.750
-What? No!
-He was killed by 108, Saga Shujiro.

35:43.833 --> 35:46.833
-Oh!
-Well, such is the Manslayer we know.

35:46.916 --> 35:49.666
[man 1] We've lost the Savage Slasher.
What a shame!

35:49.750 --> 35:50.750
[man 2 groans]

35:51.375 --> 35:54.583
Another ghost of the past has died,
nothing new.

35:56.666 --> 35:59.541
However, I'd say
that's still cause for celebration.

35:59.625 --> 36:01.666
[chuckles] I agree.

36:01.750 --> 36:03.291
-Of course.
-[chuckles]

36:03.375 --> 36:06.333
Lord Kawaji, I think you should get going.

36:06.416 --> 36:08.166
[ominous music playing]

36:11.625 --> 36:13.500
Certain duties require my attention.

36:13.583 --> 36:16.583
So for now, I'll have
to leave you all to it, I'm afraid.

36:16.666 --> 36:19.208
Naturally. You're a busy man, of course.

36:19.291 --> 36:20.333
Sir,

36:21.208 --> 36:22.291
so it's finally time.

36:24.500 --> 36:28.458
I'm sure you'll be very entertained
as the Kodoku keeps unfolding.

36:36.375 --> 36:37.666
[door opens]

36:44.500 --> 36:46.416
[ominous music continues]

36:49.583 --> 36:52.041
I've sent a telegram
informing them where to meet.

36:52.583 --> 36:53.583
Glad to hear it.

36:53.666 --> 36:55.750
Keep those wealthy fools
busy with their pleasures.

36:55.833 --> 36:57.208
As you command, sir.

36:58.291 --> 37:00.291
-[coachman clicks tongue]
-[horse neighs]

37:08.208 --> 37:09.458
[clock ticking]

37:09.541 --> 37:11.041
[knocking]

37:11.916 --> 37:13.208
Come in.

37:13.291 --> 37:14.583
[ominous music fades]

37:14.666 --> 37:15.750
If I may.

37:18.333 --> 37:21.625
It seems Lord Kawaji is back.
He's just returned from his journey.

37:22.875 --> 37:25.458
I'll pay him a visit.
Get the carriage ready.

37:25.541 --> 37:26.625
Sir.

37:26.708 --> 37:28.958
Shinpei hasn't been in touch yet, has he?

37:30.083 --> 37:30.958
No, sir.

37:31.041 --> 37:33.625
We've checked at his home as well,
but he doesn't appear to be back.

37:33.708 --> 37:35.791
Should we have the police look for him?

37:38.125 --> 37:42.750
No. We'll search for him ourselves.
Inform the Home Ministry staff.

37:42.833 --> 37:43.666
[man] Yes, sir.

37:47.416 --> 37:48.791
-[exhales]
-[door closes]

38:04.166 --> 38:05.791
[carriage approaching]

38:08.500 --> 38:09.958
[horse neighs]

38:23.208 --> 38:24.916
[ominous music playing]

38:34.000 --> 38:35.250
[horse neighing]

38:36.291 --> 38:38.166
-[coachman] What are you--
-[sword slashing]

38:38.250 --> 38:39.750
[coachman groaning]

38:39.833 --> 38:40.875
[horse running away]

38:49.875 --> 38:53.000
I know it's been awhile, Lord Okubo.

38:55.416 --> 38:57.625
Hanjiro, you're alive.

38:58.583 --> 38:59.833
I thought you were dead.

39:00.666 --> 39:04.750
Unfortunately,
Lord Kawaji will not be heading this way.

39:08.583 --> 39:09.625
What are you saying?

39:09.708 --> 39:14.166
[Sakura] He sent me instead.
And he asked me to deliver a message.

39:14.916 --> 39:16.125
"Farewell."

39:17.125 --> 39:19.000
-[groaning]
-[somber music playing]

39:19.083 --> 39:21.333
-[sword tearing flesh]
-[blood gushing]

39:21.416 --> 39:22.500
[coughing]

39:26.708 --> 39:27.708
[gasping]

39:51.375 --> 39:53.125
[somber music continues]

39:54.125 --> 39:55.416
[Maejima panting]

40:09.791 --> 40:10.916
What is this?

40:13.500 --> 40:15.416
What exactly is going on here?

40:15.500 --> 40:16.916
[music fades]

40:17.000 --> 40:18.000
[indistinct chatter]

40:18.083 --> 40:21.583
OKAZAKI-JUKU

40:24.750 --> 40:26.291
[Futaba] Shujiro.

40:26.375 --> 40:28.375
Do you think Iroha is doing okay?

40:28.875 --> 40:30.583
Knowing her,
I've no doubt she's all right.

40:30.666 --> 40:32.125
[bell ringing]

40:32.208 --> 40:34.583
[vendor] Extra! Extra!

40:34.666 --> 40:36.541
-Extra! Extra!
-What? What is it?

40:36.625 --> 40:37.583
Oh, give me one too.

40:37.666 --> 40:38.833
Extra!

40:38.916 --> 40:41.333
-[man 1] One over here, please.
-Excuse me. Can I have one too?

40:41.416 --> 40:43.166
[vendor] Extra! Extra!

40:43.666 --> 40:46.041
-[vendor] This is most urgent news!
-[Futaba] Oh no. Wait.

40:46.125 --> 40:47.791
HOME MINISTER TOSHIMICHI OKUBO
ASSASSINATED

40:47.875 --> 40:49.500
Lord Okubo was killed?

40:51.541 --> 40:53.375
Who would do something like that?

40:56.541 --> 40:58.416
This is no coincidence.

40:59.458 --> 41:00.541
What?

41:02.000 --> 41:03.833
The Kodoku is related to this.

41:04.333 --> 41:05.500
[footsteps approaching]

41:07.166 --> 41:08.541
Are you Mr. Saga?

41:10.500 --> 41:11.625
Yes, why?

41:11.708 --> 41:13.250
I have a message from Lord Maejima.

41:13.333 --> 41:16.625
"Returning to Tokyo. Urgent matter.
Make for the capital at once."

41:16.708 --> 41:18.000
That is all.

41:20.708 --> 41:21.958
I understand.

41:22.041 --> 41:23.666
[messenger] If you'll excuse me.

41:24.916 --> 41:26.291
[footsteps receding]

41:27.541 --> 41:28.458
Futaba.

41:30.666 --> 41:33.083
We need to make it to Tokyo quickly.

41:33.166 --> 41:35.250
[dramatic music playing]

41:35.333 --> 41:36.500
All right.

41:43.666 --> 41:45.750
[man 2] Make way! Carriage coming through!

41:45.833 --> 41:48.541
[crowd gasping, exclaiming]

42:03.625 --> 42:05.958
[dramatic music intensifies]

42:25.375 --> 42:27.333
[dramatic music fades]

42:27.416 --> 42:29.000
[insects chirping]

42:31.416 --> 42:32.250
[moans]

42:33.666 --> 42:35.083
-Oh.
-[exhales]

42:35.166 --> 42:37.500
Don't strain yourself.
The wound will reopen.

42:38.666 --> 42:39.750
Thank you.

42:51.208 --> 42:53.375
-Hey, you two.
-[Sansuke] Hm?

42:56.166 --> 42:57.875
I had a dream last night.

43:00.500 --> 43:03.000
I saw us all living together as a family.

43:05.291 --> 43:08.458
Sansuke and I were arguing,
like we always did.

43:11.791 --> 43:13.541
Shikura was strong as always.

43:15.541 --> 43:17.875
We all used to smile a lot back then.

43:19.416 --> 43:21.625
[chuckles softly] Sure.

43:22.583 --> 43:23.958
We certainly did.

43:26.291 --> 43:28.875
Had we all fought each other
for the succession,

43:31.250 --> 43:33.041
I would not have survived.

43:39.458 --> 43:41.833
If Shujiro hadn't decided to run away…

43:42.958 --> 43:44.666
[brooding music playing]

43:47.083 --> 43:49.166
…I certainly wouldn't be alive right now.

43:56.125 --> 43:58.583
But unless we're able to defeat Gentosai,

44:01.250 --> 44:03.416
we will never manage to move forward.

44:16.541 --> 44:18.208
Once we're all together,

44:19.833 --> 44:21.583
we can finally take him down.

44:24.166 --> 44:25.375
You know it too.

44:27.958 --> 44:30.416
We cannot defeat him
unless we're together.

44:36.666 --> 44:38.166
[Sansuke] You're right.

44:39.458 --> 44:40.708
And we'll do it.

44:41.666 --> 44:42.750
[Shikura] Yes.

44:43.416 --> 44:46.041
So now, we gather our brothers.

44:48.583 --> 44:50.166
[indistinct chatter]

44:50.250 --> 44:52.041
[brooding music continues]

44:58.166 --> 44:59.166
[sighs]

44:59.791 --> 45:01.583
[dramatic music playing]

45:02.250 --> 45:04.958
-[man 1] Oh!
-Attacked in Shimizudani. [laughs]

45:05.041 --> 45:06.416
I can't believe he actually did it!

45:06.500 --> 45:08.916
Kawaji's a man of action, truly.
Wouldn't you agree?

45:09.000 --> 45:11.666
Now we can focus on the Kodoku in peace!

45:11.750 --> 45:12.875
Indeed.

45:13.458 --> 45:16.708
There are plenty
of remarkable contestants left to watch.

45:16.791 --> 45:18.708
The weak ones are gone.

45:18.791 --> 45:21.416
From here, only the strong remain.

45:28.791 --> 45:32.125
-[men exclaiming, laughing]
-[man 2] Well, well.

45:32.208 --> 45:34.458
CHIRYU, OKAZAKI, HAMAMATSU, SHIMADA

45:37.125 --> 45:38.333
Now, gentlemen.

45:38.833 --> 45:41.666
We guarantee this Kodoku
will keep you entertained.

45:43.000 --> 45:44.583
-Hear, hear.
-Hear, hear.

45:44.666 --> 45:46.916
-[man 1] Hey! Wait for me!
-[man 2] Go! Quick!

45:47.583 --> 45:48.875
[groaning]

45:51.000 --> 45:53.708
-[man 1] Let's play some more.
-[groaning]

45:53.791 --> 45:54.791
[man 1 grunts]

45:57.166 --> 45:58.041
Well, lucky me.

45:59.041 --> 46:01.125
No one was around,
so I didn't get enough tags earlier.

46:02.958 --> 46:03.791
[groans]

46:03.875 --> 46:05.125
[man 1 grunts]

46:09.916 --> 46:12.500
Good. That's enough for now.

46:14.375 --> 46:17.000
Oh. Do you want to fight, sir?

46:18.125 --> 46:19.291
[exhales sharply]

46:19.375 --> 46:20.375
It's fun!

46:20.458 --> 46:22.041
Come on. Why not?

46:23.166 --> 46:25.041
[dramatic music continues]

46:34.416 --> 46:36.000
[Kamuykocha praying in Ainu]

46:41.500 --> 46:42.375
[bell tinkling]

46:49.250 --> 46:51.625
Well, well, so you couldn't get it done.

46:51.708 --> 46:53.958
[chuckles]
Even with the tip I gave you, huh?

46:54.041 --> 46:55.041
[gasps]

47:08.750 --> 47:12.250
Fight to the death,
until the last one standing.

47:12.958 --> 47:14.208
[yelling]

47:17.458 --> 47:19.375
[dramatic music intensifies]

47:37.750 --> 47:40.666
LAST SAMURAI STANDING

47:40.750 --> 47:43.416
THE END OF THE FIRST CHAPTER

47:43.500 --> 47:45.500
[brooding music playing]

49:27.916 --> 49:29.916
[dramatic music playing]

51:23.166 --> 51:24.541
[music fades]
